### NOTE For OLSRT v1.3.0 Atom
In this release, we have many new interesting features:

> New sub-modules for Actors and Supervisors.
> Full isolation, serializing and so on features are included in Actors and Supervisors.
> Performance optimized in Actors and Supervisors.
> Many new optimizations added for Coroutines.
> Oroutines (OLSRT Coroutines) added.
> Cross-platform module (`platform`) added.
> Many new interesting features added and note in `CHANGELOG.md`.
> Some bugs fixed.
